sw/completions/ - shell completion
==================================

    cgra.bash    bash completion for the cgra CLI. Completes subcommands and
                 options, and - by shelling out to `cgra modes`/`devices`/
                 `io`/`pipelines` - the live names from your configuration.

Use it
------
    source sw/completions/cgra.bash          # this shell only
    # or install system-wide:
    install -Dm644 sw/completions/cgra.bash \
        /etc/bash_completion.d/cgra          # or .../share/bash-completion/completions/cgra

Needs `cgra` on $PATH for the dynamic (mode/device) completions; the static
subcommand/option lists work regardless.
